public with sharing class ParkingController { public class SensorPagedResult { @AuraEnabled public List<Sensor__c> sensors {get;set;} @AuraEnabled public Integer totalRecords {get;set;} @AuraEnabled public Integer pageSize {get;set;} @AuraEnabled public Integer pageNumber {get;set;} } @AuraEnabled(cacheable=true) public static Integer getDefaultPageSize() { Parking_Settings__c settings = Parking_Settings__c.getInstance(); if (settings != null && settings.Default_Page_Size__c != null) { return Integer.valueOf(settings.Default_Page_Size__c); } return 10; } @AuraEnabled(cacheable=true) public static SensorPagedResult getSensors(String statusFilter, Integer pageNumber, Integer pageSize) { String queryBase = 'FROM Sensor__c'; String whereClause = ''; if (statusFilter != null && statusFilter != 'All') { whereClause = ' WHERE Status__c = :statusFilter'; } Integer totalRecords = Database.countQuery('SELECT COUNT() ' + queryBase + whereClause); Integer offset = (pageNumber - 1) * pageSize; String dataQuery = 'SELECT Id, Name, Sensor_Model__c, Status__c, Base_Station__c, Base_Station__r.Name ' + queryBase + whereClause + ' ORDER BY CreatedDate DESC LIMIT :pageSize OFFSET :offset'; SensorPagedResult result = new SensorPagedResult(); result.sensors = Database.query(dataQuery); result.totalRecords = totalRecords; result.pageSize = pageSize; result.pageNumber = pageNumber; return result; } @AuraEnabled public static void processCsvUpload(String base64Data) { if (String.isBlank(base64Data)) { throw new AuraHandledException('CSV file content cannot be blank.'); } String fileContent = EncodingUtil.base64Decode(base64Data).toString(); List<String> lines = fileContent.split('\n'); if (lines.size() <= 1) { throw new AuraHandledException('CSV file is empty or contains only headers.'); } Map<String, Base_Station__c> stationMap = new Map<String, Base_Station__c>(); for (Base_Station__c bs : [SELECT Id, Name FROM Base_Station__c]) { stationMap.put(bs.Name.trim().toLowerCase(), bs); } List<Sensor__c> sensorsToUpsert = new List<Sensor__c>(); for (Integer i = 1; i < lines.size(); i++) { String line = lines[i].trim(); if (String.isBlank(line)) continue; List<String> csvRow = line.split','; if (csvRow.size() < 3) continue; String sensorModel = csvRow[0].trim(); String sensorStatus = csvRow[1].trim(); String stationName = csvRow[2].trim(); Base_Station__c targetStation; String stationKey = stationName.toLowerCase(); if (stationMap.containsKey(stationKey)) { targetStation = stationMap.get(stationKey); } else { targetStation = new Base_Station__c(Name = stationName, Status__c = 'Active'); insert targetStation; stationMap.put(stationKey, targetStation); } Sensor__c sensor = new Sensor__c(Sensor_Model__c = sensorModel, Status__c = sensorStatus, Base_Station__c = targetStation.Id); sensorsToUpsert.add(sensor); } if (!sensorsToUpsert.isEmpty()) { upsert sensorsToUpsert; } } @AuraEnabled public static void deleteSensor(String recordId) { if (String.isNotBlank(recordId)) { delete [SELECT Id FROM Sensor__c WHERE Id = :recordId]; } } }